@startuml
actor Client
participant CreateGoogleSignInChallengeController as Controller
participant CreateGoogleSignInChallengeHandler as Handler
database SQLServer as Database

Client -> Controller: POST /api/auth/google/challenge
Controller -> Handler: CreateGoogleSignInChallengeCommand
Handler -> Handler: Generate random nonce and UTC expiry
Handler -> Database: Delete expired challenges
Handler -> Database: Insert nonce and expiry
Database --> Handler: Challenge saved
Handler --> Controller: Nonce and expiry
Controller --> Client: 200 OK with nonce and expiresAtUtc
@enduml
